However, due to the way the code is currently structured, the assets reserved for withdrawal may end up being lower than they should , causing the withdrawal to remain in the [withdrawal queue](https://docs.wildcat.finance/using-wildcat/terminology#withdrawal-queue) instead of moving to the [unclaimed withdrawals pool](https://docs.wildcat.finance/using-wildcat/terminology#unclaimed-withdrawals-pool).

